{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>It shall be holy to you; from the field you shall eat its produce.</b> Although I forbade the owners to use it for sowing and reaping, and not to gather all the field's produce to themselves as in other years — as it says (Leviticus 25:11) וְלֹא תִקְצְרוּ אֶת סְפִיחֶיהָ וְלֹא תִבְצְרוּ — I did not forbid the owners to eat of its fruit; rather, they are permitted to eat its produce like any other person, as in the seventh year."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:53.641166576Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}